    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Faceball Captain is a football management deck builder. Sculpt your club to overpower your opponents and rise to the top of the Faceball pyramid!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690510/extras/597712d957814710ca91ad0f6990f270.poster.avif?t=1755515998\" width=780 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690510/extras/597712d957814710ca91ad0f6990f270.webm?t=1755515998\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690510/extras/597712d957814710ca91ad0f6990f270.mp4?t=1755515998\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scout promising players, recruit offbeat staff, and build a squad that\u2019s primed to dominate the league from the ground up.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balance your books with sharp deals, clever gambles, and just enough luck to stay out of the red.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690510/extras/7a8c925a584297eaf987846c0188d9ca.poster.avif?t=1755515998\" width=780 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690510/extras/7a8c925a584297eaf987846c0188d9ca.webm?t=1755515998\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690510/extras/7a8c925a584297eaf987846c0188d9ca.mp4?t=1755515998\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb the ranks and face fiercer competition at every turn, with bigger stakes and greater rewards waiting at the top.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn your place in the prestigious Super Leagues and push your limits to see just how far your team can go</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690510/extras/963ebb3ddd175372fae244164277011e.poster.avif?t=1755515998\" width=780 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690510/extras/963ebb3ddd175372fae244164277011e.webm?t=1755515998\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690510/extras/963ebb3ddd175372fae244164277011e.mp4?t=1755515998\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft devastating combos by syncing up unique staff traits and player abilities for maximum impact on the pitch.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Twist the rules in your favor and exploit every loophole to give your team the winning edge.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690510/extras/52cc73c5c1e088685774aa0228b1bfaa.poster.avif?t=1755515998\" width=780 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690510/extras/52cc73c5c1e088685774aa0228b1bfaa.webm?t=1755515998\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690510/extras/52cc73c5c1e088685774aa0228b1bfaa.mp4?t=1755515998\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endlessly replayable, packed with content and layered strategies to discover - no two runs are the same</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>20+ Unique Player Abilities</strong><br>Build unstoppable combos by mixing and matching powerful traits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>40+ Rule-Bending Staff Members</strong><br>Hire specialists who twist the rules and empower your squad in unexpected ways.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>8 Distinct Captains</strong><br>Each brings their own pros, cons, and tactical flavor to your team.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>9 Random Callers</strong><br>Mysterious figures who may bless your run\u2026 or throw chaos into the mix</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690510/extras/f240306f9c6de6732ba0ffa785da231f.poster.avif?t=1755515998\" width=780 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690510/extras/f240306f9c6de6732ba0ffa785da231f.webm?t=1755515998\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690510/extras/f240306f9c6de6732ba0ffa785da231f.mp4?t=1755515998\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Faceball Captain, the irreverent take on Football Management. Coming 2025!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
